<section class="page-intro wrap policy-intro" aria-labelledby="policy-title"><p class="eyebrow">Website data</p><h1 id="policy-title">How this website <span class="muted">handles data.</span></h1><p class="lede">What solarityai.com collects, what it does not, and which other services you reach from it.</p></section>
{#- -#}
<section class="policy-body wrap" aria-label="How this website handles data">
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Scope</h2><p>This page describes this website only. Each app’s privacy details are on its App Store and Google Play listing, linked from its page: {% for app in apps %}<a href="/apps/{{ app.slug }}">{{ app.name }}</a>{% if loop.revindex == 2 %}, and {% elif not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}. The SaaS products are separate services on their own sites. What Solarity AI does with the personal information you send is in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Cookies and storage</h2><p>This website sets no cookies and stores nothing in your browser.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Analytics</h2><p>Cloudflare Web Analytics counts page views without cookies. Solarity AI adds no other analytics, advertising, or tracking scripts. Links to the app stores and the SaaS products may carry a campaign tag that names this website and the page the link sits on, so those services can count visits from here; the tag says nothing about you.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Contacting us</h2><p>Email links open your own email app, so nothing you write passes through this website. Booking a conversation opens Google Calendar’s appointment page, and the product feedback, mentorship and certificate forms open Google Forms; Google’s terms apply there, and what you submit goes to Solarity AI through Google, not through this website. Links to Solarity AI’s social channels open those services, under their own terms.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Applying for a role</h2><p>The careers form sends the details you enter to FormSubmit, a form-forwarding service, to be emailed to careers@solarityai.com. <a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">FormSubmit’s privacy policy <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a> applies to that step.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Hosting and security</h2><p>Cloudflare hosts this website and serves it only over HTTPS. A strict content security policy limits which scripts can run, and security issues can be reported as described in <a href="/.well-known/security.txt">security.txt <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>.</p></div>
<div class="policy-section"><h2>Questions</h2><p>Email <a href="mailto:{{ email }}?subject=Solarity%20AI%20%7C%20Website%20data">{{ email }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>.</p></div>
</section>
